I started this level with the intention to make a =oC less useful than
it is on the original level. But I'm not sure if a =oC is as useless
on this level as I'd wanted to.

This level has lots of drawbridges and lots of ironbars because there
are just to few level in vanilla NetHack that use these features. :-)


To get to the Fort the player has to overcome two mighty walls, each
filled with dangerous centaurs possibly armed with more dangerous
weapons than usual.

In front of each wall a small group of soldiers are waiting for the
player. In front of the Fort a large group of soldiers and a big group
of elves with long range weapons want to stop any intruder.

